{"id":"W5d7d890a3e1afdb2ccf106a2","zh":"交叉干扰项","en":"","name":"交叉干扰项","language":"zh","domain":"铁路动力学、信号与建模方法","concept_id":"C0413b4dbb72dc04e77f4","families":[],"definition_zh":"多分量时频分布中由分量之间耦合产生、可能干扰信号解释的项。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":"利用小波分频预处理减少 Wigner–Ville 交叉项。","usage_overview":"指多分量信号在双线性时频分布中由分量间耦合产生的干扰成分，可能妨碍信号特征的辨识。在轨道不平顺分析中，可通过小波分频预处理减少Wigner–Ville分布中的此类交叉项。","translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W5d7d890a3e1afdb2ccf106a2","text":"交叉干扰项","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"Sdf2e42e20ebc1f14e361","source_id":"P101","page":3,"page_end":3,"language":"zh","text":"采用离散二进小波算法,将轨道不平顺信号划分到不同的频率段,在各个频率子空间细化不平顺信号的分析范围,减少在 Wigner- Ville 处理时交叉干扰项的出现。","citations":[{"source_id":"P101","page":3,"page_end":3}]},{"id":"Sd74f43208a729451dbb2","source_id":"P101","page":7,"page_end":7,"language":"zh","text":"多分辩率分析, Wigner- Ville 分布良好的时-频能量聚集性以及 Hough 变换低信噪比下的线性频率准确提取性能,可以较大程度地抑制或消除多分量信和号在某些频段的交叉干扰项, 能准确提取轨道结构中高能量不平顺的波长成分。","citations":[{"source_id":"P101","page":7,"page_end":7}]}],"sources":{"P101":{"id":"P101","title":"基于小波和Wigner-Hough变换的轨道特征不平顺联合分析","authors":"徐磊；陈宪麦","year":"2014","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2014.05.015","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2014）","overview_slug":"2014-wavelet-wigner-hough-track-irregularity"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"多分量双线性时频分布中的干扰成分。","language":"zh","source_id":"P101","paper_slug":"2014-wavelet-wigner-hough-track-irregularity","title":"基于小波和Wigner-Hough变换的轨道特征不平顺联合分析","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"Wb45a3b46bf7f33a4ea7f1cca","name":"cross-terms","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"参考译法","reason":null},{"id":"W863d927ec61062ca80750188","name":"cross distracters","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"Wb45a3b46bf7f33a4ea7f1cca","na